      "writtenOn": "2022-06-15T17:18:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`alt-usb-mux` is used to force generation of `struct usb_mux` for USB muxes that are not part of the `named-usbc-port` chain. I think it isn\u0027t possible to use `alt-usb-mux-chain` for generating `struct usb_mux` as this would lead to duplicated structures (e.g. `virtual_mux_c0` would be generated twice). Once again the problem is that `struct usb_mux` contains both mux specific data and pointer to next mux.",
      "parentUuid": "4ef4a74f_7294d575",
